source: crates/hydronode-cli/tests/c3_help.rs
expression: text
---
A profile is a server plus its own login. Use one with -p NAME.

Usage: hn profile [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    List profiles and their servers
  add     Add or change a profile
  remove  Remove a profile and its stored login
  use     Use a profile by default

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn profile add work --server https://hydronode.tech
  hn -p work login
  hn profile use work
  hn profile list
